() Tj
T*
(This project is an end-to-end cloud-native demonstration that connects two Java 21 Spring Boot) Tj
T*
(microservices through Azure Service Bus and runs them on Azure Kubernetes Service \(AKS\). The) Tj
T*
(infrastructure is declared through Terraform, delivery is handled through GitOps using ArgoCD,) Tj
T*
(progressive deployment behavior is managed by Argo Rollouts, and runtime visibility is provided) Tj
T*
(through Prometheus, Grafana, Jaeger, Elasticsearch, Kibana, and Fluentd.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The application domain is intentionally small so the platform patterns are easy to) Tj
T*
(see.orders-serviceaccepts an order creation request over HTTP and publishes anOrderEventto an) Tj
T*
(Azure Service Bus queue.payments-serviceconsumes the same queue and records message processing) Tj
T*
(success or failure. Both services expose Spring Actuator health and Prometheus endpoints, emit) Tj
T*
(structured logs outside local mode, and use Azure workload identity rather than connection) Tj
T*
(strings in AKS.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The project demonstrates several production-aligned practices: remote Terraform execution) Tj
T*
(through HCP Terraform, Azure managed identities with federated Kubernetes service accounts, ACR) Tj
T*
(image publishing, app-of-apps GitOps, canary and blue-green rollout strategies, Gateway API) Tj
T*
(ingress, Prometheus alerting rules, and JSON log shipping into Elasticsearch.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
