(4. AZURE INFRASTRUCTURE PROVISIONING WITH TERRAFORM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The Terraform environment underinfra/envs/azure-devis the central composition layer. It defines) Tj
T*
(the resource group and invokes reusable modules for the core Azure landing zone and workload) Tj
T*
(dependencies. Naming is controlled through locals using the) Tj
T*
(format<resource-type>-asbdemo-dev-sin, with a no-dash variant for globally constrained resources) Tj
T*
(such as ACR.) Tj
T*
() Tj
