T*
() Tj
T*
(The stack requires Terraform>= 1.9.0and uses theazurerm,azuread, andrandomproviders. The) Tj
T*
(Terraform cloud block points to organizationvinod-techops-organd workspaceazure-dev, so local) Tj
T*
(commands stream remote HCP Terraform runs rather than executing plans locally.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Provider features intentionally setprevent_deletion_if_contains_resources = falsefor resource) Tj
T*
(groups and configure Key Vault soft-delete recovery/purge behavior. The runbook explains) Tj
T*
(one-time OIDC federation setup for HCP Terraform so the workspace can authenticate to Azure) Tj
T*
(without storing a client secret.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
