T*
() Tj
T*
(The environment provisions one main resource group namedrg-asbdemo-dev-sin. Tags are) Tj
T*
(consistently applied with keys for application, environment, Terraform ownership, repository,) Tj
T*
(and HCP workspace. The Service Bus namespace includes a random four-character suffix to satisfy) Tj
T*
(Azure's global uniqueness requirement.) Tj
