T*
() Tj
T*
(- aks-system:10.40.1.0/24, used by the AKS system node pool.) Tj
T*
(- aks-user:10.40.2.0/24, configured with AKS pod subnet delegation) Tj
T*
(toMicrosoft.ContainerService/managedClusters.) Tj
