T*
() Tj
T*
(The monitoring module creates an Azure Log Analytics Workspace using SKUPerGB2018and default) Tj
T*
(retention of 30 days. The AKS module connects Container Insights to this workspace through) Tj
T*
(theoms_agentblock with managed identity authentication enabled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
