T*
() Tj
T*
(The Key Vault module provisions a standard SKU vault with Azure RBAC authorization enabled. Soft) Tj
T*
(delete retention defaults to seven days, purge protection is disabled for dev convenience, and) Tj
T*
(public network access is currently enabled. The vault is intended as the central secure store) Tj
T*
(for pipeline tokens and future cluster secrets.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.6 AZURE CONTAINER REGISTRY MODULE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A Basic SKU Azure Container Registry is created with admin user disabled. The AKS kubelet) Tj
T*
(identity is grantedAcrPullon this registry by the AKS module, allowing Kubernetes nodes to pull) Tj
T*
(images without static registry credentials.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.7 AKS MODULE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The AKS cluster is configured with workload identity and OIDC issuer enabled. It uses a) Tj
T*
(system-assigned control plane identity, Azure CNI networking, Cilium network policy, Cilium data) Tj
T*
(plane, Standard load balancer, and outbound typeloadBalancer. The service CIDR) Tj
T*
(is10.200.0.0/16with DNS service IP10.200.0.10.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Node pools are split by function:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pool | Mode | Default size | Role) Tj
T*
(system | System | Standard_B2als_v2, one node | Runs critical cluster add-ons only.) Tj
T*
(user | User | Standard_D2s_v4, autoscale min 3 max 5 | Runs application and platform workloads,) Tj
T*
(labeledworkload=apps.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The cluster uses automatic patch upgrades and ignores drift on Kubernetes version and node) Tj
