(Both services request100mCPU and384Mimemory, with limits of500mCPU and512Mimemory. They define) Tj
T*
(startup, readiness, and liveness probes against Spring Boot actuator endpoints. Each pod has a) Tj
T*
(40-second termination grace period and a five-second pre-stop sleep to give the service time to) Tj
T*
(drain during rollout transitions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Both deployments set OpenTelemetry environment variables that send traces over OTLP gRPC) Tj
T*
(tojaeger.jaeger.svc.cluster.local:4317. Metrics and logs exporters are disabled in the) Tj
T*
(OpenTelemetry agent configuration because Prometheus scrapes metrics directly and Fluentd ships) Tj
T*
(container logs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. GATEWAY API AND TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The platform installs Gateway API standard CRDs and NGINX Gateway Fabric. The workload overlay) Tj
T*
(defines anNginxProxy, aGateway, and anHTTPRoute. The Gateway listens on HTTP port 80 and allows) Tj
T*
(routes from the same namespace. The HTTPRoute is namedorders, uses hostnameorders.asbdemo.local,) Tj
T*
(matches path prefix/orders, and sends traffic toorders-serviceon port 80.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NGINX Gateway Fabric is currently configured with ClusterIP services. That fits an internal or) Tj
T*
(port-forwarded dev setup. For internet-facing access, the NGINX service or Gateway) Tj
T*
(infrastructure would need to expose a public load balancer or be integrated with an) Tj
T*
(ingress/load-balancer pattern appropriate for the target environment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. PROGRESSIVE DELIVERY WITH ARGO ROLLOUTS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10.1 ORDERS-SERVICE CANARY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(orders-serviceuses a canary rollout with weight steps of 25%, 50%, and 75%, each followed by a) Tj
T*
(30-second pause. Starting at step 1, Argo Rollouts runs thesuccess-rateAnalysisTemplate. The) Tj
T*
(Prometheus query calculates the ratio of non-5xx HTTP requests to total HTTP requests for the) Tj
T*
(service over two minutes and treats empty data as success withor vector\(1\). The rollout succeeds) Tj
T*
(when the result is at least 0.95 and fails after three failed checks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10.2 PAYMENTS-SERVICE BLUE-GREEN) Tj
ET
