(11.1 PROMETHEUS AND GRAFANA) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The platform app installskube-prometheus-stackinto namespacemonitoring. The Helm values are) Tj
T*
(tuned for a dev cluster: default rules are disabled, Prometheus retention is six hours,) Tj
T*
(persistent storage is disabled, admission webhooks and TLS for the operator are disabled, and) Tj
T*
(Grafana uses a ClusterIP service with dashboard sidecar enabled across all namespaces.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The application ServiceMonitors make Prometheus scrape both Spring Boot apps) Tj
T*
(at/actuator/prometheus. Custom application metrics include:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- orders_published_total, incremented by orders-service after a successful publish call.) Tj
T*
(- orders_processed_total, incremented by payments-service after a successful message completion.) Tj
T*
(- orders_failed_total, incremented by payments-service when a message fails processing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11.2 GRAFANA DASHBOARD) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The workload overlay includes a Grafana dashboard ConfigMap labeledgrafana_dashboard=1. The) Tj
T*
(dashboard,asbdemo overview, refreshes every 30 seconds and includes panels for order publish) Tj
T*
(rate, order process rate, failure rate, Service Bus active queue depth, throughput comparison,) Tj
T*
(HTTP 5xx rate, and JVM heap utilization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11.3 PROMETHEUS ALERTS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Alert | Condition | Intent) Tj
T*
(AsbdemoHighErrorRate | 5xx ratio above 1% for five minutes | Detect API instability.) Tj
T*
(AsbdemoHighLatency | p95 HTTP latency above 500 ms for five minutes | Detect slow user-facing) Tj
T*
(requests.) Tj
T*
(AsbdemoJvmHeapHigh | Heap usage above 90% for ten minutes | Detect memory pressure in the JVM.) Tj
T*
(AsbdemoNoOrdersPublished | No order publishes in 15 minutes during business hours | Catch) Tj
T*
(unexpected traffic silence.) Tj
T*
(AsbdemoOrdersFailedSpike | Payment failure rate above 0.5 orders per second for five minutes |) Tj
T*
(Catch consumer-side processing problems.) Tj
T*
() Tj
