(The repository implements a coherent cloud-native platform demonstration: infrastructure is) Tj
T*
(reproducible, application delivery follows GitOps, workloads use managed identity to access) Tj
T*
(Service Bus, rollouts are progressive, and observability spans metrics, logs, dashboards,) Tj
T*
(alerts, and traces. The project is already strong as a dev/demo reference architecture. The) Tj
